      {
        "line": 71,
        "text": "  The module facets to build and combine into the executable."
      },
      {
        "line": 72,
        "text": "  If `shouldExport` is true, the module facets should export any symbols"
      },
      {
        "line": 73,
        "text": "  a user may expect to lookup in the executable. For example, the Lean"
      },
      {
        "line": 74,
        "text": "  interpreter will use exported symbols in the executable. Thus, `shouldExport`"
      },
      {
        "line": 75,
        "text": "  will be `true` if `supportInterpreter := true`."
      },
      {
        "line": 76,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 77,
        "text": "  Defaults to a singleton of `Module.oExportFacet` (if `shouldExport`) or"
      },
      {
        "line": 78,
        "text": "  `Module.oFacet`. That is, the  object file compiled from the Lean source,"
      },
      {
        "line": 79,
        "text": "  potentially with exported Lean symbols."
      },
      {
        "line": 80,
        "text": "  -/"
      },
      {
        "line": 81,
        "text": "  nativeFacets (shouldExport : Bool) : Array (ModuleFacet FilePath) :="
      },
      {
        "line": 82,
        "text": "    #[if shouldExport then Module.oExportFacet else Module.oFacet]"
